# Frontend Environment Variables

## Development

Create a `.env.local` file in `src/frontend/` (this file is gitignored):

```env
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:5077/api
```

This allows the Vite dev server to connect to the backend running separately.

## Production

No `.env` file needed! The built frontend uses relative URLs (`/api`) to connect to the backend on the same origin.
